' ============================================================================
' ASSOCIATIONS FROM THE APPROVED DOMAIN MODEL (same multiplicities)
' ============================================================================
User "1" -- "0..*" Customer : is responsible for
Customer "1..*" -- "0..*" Contact : has
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Subscription : contracts
Subscription "0..*" -- "1..*" Concept : bills
Subscription "1" -- "0..*" AnnualReview : reviewed in
AnnualReview "0..*" -- "1" RateTier : proposes
Subscription "0..*" -- "0..1" RateTier : priced by
Subscription "1" -- "0..1" Cancellation : ended by
Customer "1" -- "0..*" Invoice : is billed with
Subscription "0..1" -- "0..*" Invoice : generates
Invoice "1" *-- "1..*" InvoiceLine : contains
InvoiceLine "0..*" -- "0..1" Concept : based on
Invoice "0..1" -- "0..*" Invoice : corrected by
Invoice "1" -- "0..*" Reminder : followed up by
Invoice "0..1" -- "0..*" BillingIssue : about
User "1" -- "0..*" ApprovalRequest : requests
ApprovalRequest "0..*" -- "0..1" User : decided by
ApprovalRequest "0..*" -- "0..1" Invoice : about
AutomationRun "0..1" -- "0..*" Invoice : generates
AutomationRun "0..1" -- "0..*" Reminder : sends

' Refines the domain model's Invoice "0..*" -- "0..*" Payment : settled by
' Reconciliation carries the allocated amount, its evidence and its reversal.
Invoice "1" -- "0..*" Reconciliation : settled through
Reconciliation "0..*" -- "1" Payment : allocates

' ============================================================================
' SUPPORTING ASSOCIATIONS
' ============================================================================
!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "customers")
(Customer, Contact) .. CustomerContact
!endif
CustomerImport "0..*" -- "1" User : run by
CustomerImport "0..1" -- "0..*" Customer : creates or updates
Subscription "1" *-- "0..*" SubscriptionPause : paused by
Subscription "1" *-- "0..*" CommercialException : adjusted by

Invoice "1" *-- "0..1" IssuedSnapshot : frozen as
Invoice "1" *-- "0..1" InvoiceDocument : preserved as
Invoice "0..*" -- "0..1" InvoiceSeries : numbered in
InvoiceLine "0..*" -- "1" Tax : taxed with
Concept "0..*" -- "0..1" Tax : default tax
Invoice "1" -- "0..*" DeliveryAttempt : sent through
Reminder "0..1" -- "0..*" DeliveryAttempt : dispatched through
DeliveryAttempt "0..*" -- "1..*" Contact : sent to
DeliveryAttempt "0..*" -- "0..1" MessageTemplate : uses
!if ($VIEW != "core")
Reconciliation "0..*" -- "0..1" User : allocated by
!endif
Invoice "0..*" -- "0..1" AccountingPeriod : belongs to
Customer "1" -- "0..*" BillingIssue : concerns
!if ($VIEW != "core")
BillingIssue "0..*" -- "1" User : owned by
!endif
Customer ..|> AnnotationTarget
Invoice ..|> AnnotationTarget
BillingIssue ..|> AnnotationTarget
Comment "0..*" -- "1" AnnotationTarget : written on
Attachment "0..*" -- "1" AnnotationTarget : attached to
!if ($VIEW != "core")
Comment "0..*" -- "1" User : written by
Comment "0..*" -- "0..*" User : mentions
Attachment "0..*" -- "1" User : uploaded by
!endif
AlertRule "0..*" -- "1" User : configured by

User "1" *-- "0..*" Session : opens
User "1" -- "0..*" Delegation : delegates
Delegation "0..*" -- "1" User : to
ApprovalRequest "1" *-- "1" ProposalSnapshot : decides exactly
ApprovalRequest "0..*" -- "0..1" CommercialException : about
ApprovalRequest "0..*" -- "0..1" AnnualReview : about
Invoice ..|> ApprovalSubject
CommercialException ..|> ApprovalSubject
AnnualReview ..|> ApprovalSubject
WorkTask "0..*" -- "1" User : assigned to
WorkTask "0..*" -- "0..1" Customer : concerns
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : receives
User "0..1" -- "0..*" AuditEntry : performs
ApiClient "0..1" -- "0..*" AuditEntry : performs
AutomationRun "1" *-- "0..*" AutomationItem : records
AutomationRun "0..1" -- "0..*" Backup : creates
BillingPolicy "1" -- "0..*" AutomationRun : governs
User "1" -- "0..*" ReportOutput : requests
ReportOutput "0..*" -- "0..1" AccountingPeriod : packages
SummarySchedule "0..*" -- "1..*" User : sent to
Backup "0..*" -- "0..1" User : requested by
Backup "1" -- "0..*" RecoveryExecution : restored by
RecoveryExecution "0..*" -- "1" User : confirmed by

' ============================================================================
' INTERFACE REALISATIONS AND KEY DEPENDENCIES
' ============================================================================
PaymentProviderAdapter ..|> PaymentGateway
EmailAdapter ..|> CommunicationService
WhatsAppAdapter ..|> CommunicationService
DocumentStorageAdapter ..|> DocumentStorage
PdfGeneratorAdapter ..|> PdfRenderer
SystemTimer ..> Scheduler : triggers
Scheduler ..> InvoicingController : UC-06
Scheduler ..> CollectionsController : UC-07, UC-08
Scheduler ..> CustomerSubscriptionController : UC-04 tasks
Scheduler ..> ReportingOperationsController : UC-09, UC-12
Scheduler ..> AuditBackupController : UC-21
Scheduler ..> ExecutionContext : system identity

' Controller-to-port dependencies are drawn only in the application view, because
' they would hide the domain associations in the other views.
!if ($VIEW == "application")
AccessController ..> UserRepository
AccessController ..> PasswordHasher
CustomerSubscriptionController ..> CustomerRepository
CustomerSubscriptionController ..> SubscriptionRepository
CustomerSubscriptionController ..> AnnualRevenueProvider
InvoicingController ..> InvoiceRepository
InvoicingController ..> ConfigurationRepository
InvoicingController ..> PdfRenderer
InvoicingController ..> DocumentStorage
InvoicingController ..> CommunicationService
InvoicingController ..> ApprovalController
CollectionsController ..> PaymentGateway
CollectionsController ..> PaymentRepository
CollectionsController ..> InvoiceRepository
CollectionsController ..> IssueRepository
CollectionsController ..> DocumentStorage
CollectionsController ..> CommunicationService
ApprovalController ..> ApprovalRepository
ReportingOperationsController ..> WorkRepository
ReportingOperationsController ..> ReportRepository
ReportingOperationsController ..> AccountingPeriodRepository
ReportingOperationsController ..> PdfRenderer
ConfigurationController ..> ConfigurationRepository
AuditBackupController ..> AuditRepository
AuditBackupController ..> AutomationRunRepository
AuditBackupController ..> BackupRepository
AuditBackupController ..> BackupEngine
!endif

' ============================================================================
