' Core view only: each label names real operations, so the members can stay hidden.
!if ($VIEW == "core")
hide members
show Invoice fields
show AnnualReview fields
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 110
CustomerSubscriptionController ..> Subscription : confirmSubscription, confirmCancellation
InvoicingController ..> Invoice : prepareDraft, issueInvoice, correctInvoice
InvoicingController ..> DeliveryAttempt : sendInvoice, receiveDeliveryReport
CollectionsController ..> Payment : receivePaymentNotification
CollectionsController ..> Reconciliation : allocateManually, reverseReconciliation
CollectionsController ..> BillingIssue : openIssue, resolveIssue
CollectionsController ..> AnnotationTarget : addComment, addAttachment
ApprovalController ..> ApprovalRequest : decide
InvoicingController ..> InvoiceRepository : save
InvoicingController ..> PdfRenderer : renderInvoice
InvoicingController ..> DocumentStorage : store
InvoicingController ..> CommunicationService : send, verifyDeliveryReport
CollectionsController ..> PaymentGateway : queryTransactions, verifyNotification
Payment -[hidden]down- PaymentGateway
DeliveryAttempt -[hidden]down- CommunicationService
Cancellation -[hidden]down- InvoiceRepository
PaymentGateway -[hidden]down- Money
CommunicationService -[hidden]down- DeliveryEvidence
!endif

!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "core")
legend top right
  |<#FFF3C9> Main entity |
  |<#FFFFFF> Supporting entity or contract |
  |<#D9E4F7> Controller |
  |<#DDF0E0> Port |
  |<#F0F0F0> Value object |
  |<#E2E2E2> Infrastructure |
endlegend
!endif

' ============================================================================
' DESIGN NOTES (shown only in the views that contain their class)
' ============================================================================
!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "invoicing")
note right of Invoice
  **Separate stages.** prepareDraft and saveDraft (UC-05)
  never set a number. issue() (UC-19) is the only operation
  that assigns one, once, and freezes IssuedSnapshot.
  sendInvoice (UC-20) only adds DeliveryAttempt objects.
  Retries reuse the same number and original PDF.
  Corrections are new linked invoices (UC-15).
end note

note bottom of Reconciliation
  **Replaces the simplified Invoice-Payment link.**
  One allocation of a verified payment to one invoice.
  Same currency as both. reverse() keeps the original
  evidence. Paid status derives from active allocations.
end note

note left of Invoice
  **Balance (FR2.8.2, UC-15).** Original and correction count once:
  outstandingBalance = max(adjustedTotal - allocatedAmount, 0)
  excessAmount = max(allocatedAmount - adjustedTotal, 0)
  adjustedTotal adds issued corrections only; allocatedAmount adds
  active allocations only. A corrective document reports 0 itself.
  Excess is never a payment or a refund. calculateObligations sums
  per currency and never converts. The signed form of a correction
  is a proposal: see the traceability file, section 4.
end note

note bottom of DeliveryAttempt
  **Only verified evidence changes the result.** A report enters through
  receiveDeliveryReport: CommunicationService verifies its origin, the
  provider reference selects the attempt, matches() checks the channel,
  and an unverified or unmatched report changes nothing. No operation
  accepts a status from a caller.
end note

note top of AnnotationTarget
  **Exactly one target.** A comment or attachment has one customer,
  invoice or issue. Scope and permissions come from the target, and
  an issue's invoice must belong to the issue's customer. Restricted
  notes are for administrators; mentions notify only users who can
  see the comment. No operation sends these to a customer.
end note
!endif

!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "governance")
note top of ApprovalRequest
  Exactly one of invoice, commercial exception or annual
  review is the subject {xor}. A decision applies only
  to the stored ProposalSnapshot version; a changed
  proposal makes it stale. canBeDecidedBy() checks the
  threshold role and separation of duties (FR11.1).
end note
!endif

!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "customers")
note bottom of Cancellation
  **Independent of old debt (C4).** Has no link to Invoice
  and no operation changes one. stopBillingFrom() only
  stops future recurring billing.
end note
!endif

!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "application" || $VIEW == "core")
note top of Scheduler
  Internal application element, never an actor. It holds no
  business rules: it calls the same controllers as users,
  with a system ExecutionContext. Each run is an AutomationRun.
end note

!endif

!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "application")
note bottom of PaymentGateway
  Only checks payments. No charge or payment-link
  operation: that is out of scope.
end note

note bottom of AuditRepository
  Append-only: no update or delete operation exists.
end note
!endif

!if ($VIEW == "all" || $VIEW == "types")
note top of Money
  All amounts use Decimal with an explicit currency.
  Money never converts or adds across currencies.
end note
!endif

' ============================================================================
' VIEWS: filter the single definition above; nothing is redefined. Packages exist
' only in the complete view, so the filtered views show no empty package boxes.
' ============================================================================
!if ($VIEW != "all")
remove $application
remove $customers
remove $invoicing
remove $governance
remove $types
!endif
!if ($VIEW == "core")
restore $core
!elseif ($VIEW == "customers")
restore $customers
!elseif ($VIEW == "invoicing")
restore $invoicing
!elseif ($VIEW == "governance")
restore $governance
!elseif ($VIEW == "application")
restore $application
!elseif ($VIEW == "types")
restore $types
!endif

@enduml
